Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Isolate state dispatch concurrency by cron schedule
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Daily/hourly schedule events must not cancel each other when queued or delayed.
Include github.event.schedule in the group while retaining event separation.

Finding 2 from review 6002304307 was already fixed in the cited merge
e667441167eb8a1f3213456a7da9a79bd9a5b67b. Retain its title-sensitive fake and
missing-run coverage; independently replay their regression proofs here.

